# How to organize data in a project

## Top-level structure

```
├─ data/
│  ├─ raw/                     # Immutable data
│  ├─ intermediate/            # Processed intermediate outputs
│  ├─ processed/               # Final processed outputs
│  └─ labeling/                # Labeling data
```

## Labeling data organization (incorporates NACSOS)

```
├─ labeling/
│  ├─ raw/
│  │  ├─ round01/
│  │  │  ├─ 01_nacsos_import/
│  │  │  ├─ 02_nacsos_export/
│  │  │  ├─ 03_discussion/
│  │  │  ├─ 04_resolved/
│  │  │  ├─ 05_deet_ready/
```
